    "sections": [
      "8",
      "16.3 F7"
    ],
    "summary": "The F6 shape on the web tier, plus the two rules that exist only for NX: the zero-length message-1 payload (§8.5), with a nonempty-payload case expecting FATAL-PRE `P10`; and the §8.8 step 3 responder-static byte-equality check against the advertised prekey, with a substitution case expecting `P16`.",
